  "tinai": "unknown",
  "sangamTamil": "அகத்தாரே வாழ்வார்என் றண்ணாந்து நோக்கிப்\nபுகத்தாம் பெறாஅர் பறங்கடை பற்றி\nமிகத்தாம் வருந்தி இருப்பரே மேலைத்\nதவத்தால் தவம்செய்யா தார்.",
  "urai": null,
  "english": "The door closed. Too late. ‘Yet those within are blest,' so saying, they look up, but obtain no entrance: their place is at the outer gate. There will they suffer much, who thro' lack of former penitence do no penance now. [In a former state penance won for them a human shape. As men they have now failed.]",
